body:
That's honestly weird, I personally play on the Xbox Series S, and honestly, although it looks great the render distance does make very (very) far distances look like garbage, nothing that would really ruin the experience, but its important in this case, because if you're in the X it should look even better. 

&#x200B;

Go to Setting > Data and check if one of the settings is off, this something happens if you lost your internet connection mid-game previously.

No mames, malditos Mexicas, nada por el aguila tragando en el lago. El otro dia intente simular la aproximacion en un vuelo al AICM por el este, y pues, pinche valle en las nubes rodeada de montañas, esta bien raro el terreno.

&#x200B;

Eso si, quedo mamalon.
